  metallb
    MetalLB load balancer with optional layer 2 address pools

    Provides           metallb
    Requires           none  (another instance selected for the same cluster must provide each
                       required capability)
    OLM package        metallb-operator
    Default source     redhat-operators
    Secret namespaces  metallb-system

  Channel and CSV lookup
    oc get packagemanifest metallb-operator -n openshift-marketplace -o json

  Configuration under spec.packages.metallb
  ○ field | subscription.channel
      TYPE      string
      REQUIRED  required
      DEFAULT   none

  ○ field | subscription.startingCSV
      TYPE      string
      REQUIRED  required
      DEFAULT   none

  ○ field | subscription.source
      TYPE      DNS name
      REQUIRED  optional
      DEFAULT   redhat-operators

  ○ field | subscription.sourceNamespace
      TYPE      name
      REQUIRED  optional
      DEFAULT   openshift-marketplace

  ○ field | subscription.catalogSource.name
      TYPE      name
      REQUIRED  required in subscription.catalogSource
      DEFAULT   none

  ○ field | subscription.catalogSource.image
      TYPE      image reference
      REQUIRED  required in subscription.catalogSource
      DEFAULT   none

  ○ field | subscription.catalogSource.priority
      TYPE      integer
      REQUIRED  required in subscription.catalogSource
      DEFAULT   none

  ○ field | subscription.catalogSource.pollInterval
      TYPE      duration
      REQUIRED  optional
      DEFAULT   none

  ○ field | subscription.catalogSource.securityContextConfig
      TYPE      string (legacy|restricted)
      REQUIRED  optional
      DEFAULT   restricted

  ○ field | timeout
      TYPE      duration
      REQUIRED  optional
      DEFAULT   30m

  ○ field | pools[].name
      TYPE      name
      REQUIRED  required in pools[]
      DEFAULT   none

  ○ field | pools[].addresses
      TYPE      list of string
      REQUIRED  required in pools[]
      DEFAULT   none

  ○ field | pools[].autoAssign
      TYPE      boolean
      REQUIRED  optional
      DEFAULT   true

  ○ field | pools[].l2.interface
      TYPE      string
      REQUIRED  optional
      DEFAULT   none

  ○ field | pools[].serviceAllocation.namespaces
      TYPE      list of name
      REQUIRED  optional
      DEFAULT   none

  ○ field | pools[].serviceAllocation.namespaceSelectors[].matchLabels
      TYPE      mapping
      REQUIRED  required in pools[].serviceAllocation.namespaceSelectors[]
      DEFAULT   none

  ○ field | pools[].serviceAllocation.serviceSelectors[].matchLabels
      TYPE      mapping
      REQUIRED  required in pools[].serviceAllocation.serviceSelectors[]
      DEFAULT   none

  Binding skeleton (replace each <field>)
apiVersion: bootwright.io/v1alpha1
kind: ClusterAddonBinding
metadata:
  name: metallb
spec:
  clusterRef: <clusterRef>
  packages:
    metallb:
      subscription:
        channel: <channel>
        startingCSV: <startingCSV>
        source: redhat-operators
